Package: bambamR
Title: RNA-Seq Processing from FASTQ Files to Publication-Ready Plots
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("R.", "Heller",
           email = "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742")),
    person("Hanno", "Witte", role = "aut"),
    person("Konrad", "Steinestel", role = "aut")
    )
Description: A streamlined toolkit for RNA sequencing (RNA-seq) analysis
    covering FASTQ and BAM import, quality control, alignment through
    external aligners ('STAR', 'HISAT2', 'minimap2'), read counting,
    normalization, differential expression analysis with 'DESeq2', 'edgeR'
    or 'limma', and publication-ready visualizations including oncoplots,
    volcano plots, heatmaps and principal component analysis plots. Works in
    a minimal mode with dependencies from CRAN only, or in a full mode when
    the optional 'Bioconductor' packages are installed.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
